WEBVTT

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.900
It's a pretty serious walk up
to the school building.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.000
Doesn't it just feel like "The Fujigaya"?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.870
What's all this "The" business?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.820
Please just grin and bear
it for one day, Shinobu.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.040
I haven't put on a suit since my
college entrance ceremony.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.840
Reception Desk

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.870
Oh, there she is. Achan!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.700
Huh, she vanished...

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.390
What's wrong?

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:21.400
Can I see your invitation please.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:22.540
Oh, right.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:23.110
Huh?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.530
Hello.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.790
If it isn't Fumi-chan!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.620
Do you know her?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.750
It's Achan's parents and older brother.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.980
Oh, Achan's...

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:37.060
You all go to Matsuoka, don't
you? Why are you here?

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:41.400
We're friends with Achan,
so we came here to help.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.960
Yup, we're here to help Achan.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.510
Isn't that right, Achan?

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.910
What? She's back there?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.270
If you're not doing anything,
show us the inside of the school building.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.610
How dare you...

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.490
Relax, relax.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.420
Hey, where'd Sugimoto go?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:15.130
The Little Prince is crying,
so she's consoling her.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.390
What, is she trying to make her own fanclub
in the elementary school now?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.450
Big sis, what role are you playing?

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:28.270
Me? Umm... A man who is troubled.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:30.710
Are you in trouble?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:35.180
No, it's more like he causes
trouble for everyone else.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.400
Is he a bad guy?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.860
It's kinda hard to say.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:46.060
We don't know where he came from
or what things he has done.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.530
You don't know any of it?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:53.990
That's right. The main character of
the story always seems lonely.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.280
Over here! Hurry!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.040
Catch you later.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.760
Pardon me. Is Sugimoto-sempai in?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.730
Sorry, she's not back yet.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.930
Our prince has a habit of wandering about.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:29.140
Heathcliff this, Heathcliff that...
When am I gonna get some love?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.290
Show some class, Edgar.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.520
But you have me, your sister, Isabella!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.870
You're no good either. What kind
of sister are you to betray me?

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:40.330
That's why you end up
with such misfortune.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.850
But Heath's better than Edgar.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:47.050
You're the type to be tricked by
some bad guy, you know that.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.040
Wow. How many bouquets is that?

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.070
I've lost count!

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.090
That's for the elementary school kids.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.340
How'd that get mixed in there?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:03.400
Shall I sign for our entire family?

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.150
Oh, yes, right here.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:07.980
I'm gonna bring this over to
the elementary students.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.780
Yeah? Thanks a ton.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:19.630
Fumi.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.080
Sempai.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.420
Shouldn't you be... in the auditorium?

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.370
I paid the elementary kids a visit.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:31.690
What about you, Fumi?

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.680
I was bringing this to them.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.160
We almost walked right by each
other... But we didn't!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.350
Yes, something feels special about it.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.990
Fate is a special thing.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.060
It truly is.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.040
Are you going to watch the
play from the wing?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.720
I'm going to watch with the audience,
since it's the main performance.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.000
OK.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.450
Come and see me the minute it's over!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.670
I will.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.570
Let's order cake.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.130
What are you getting, Achan?

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.550
I'm good. I have to get out of here anyway.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.380
Oh, you can stay for a few minutes.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.870
So, what do you recommend?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.790
Oh, wow, so Wuthering Heights
isn't a geographical location.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.750
It's the name of a manor, duh.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:39.200
Gimme a break. How the
heck would I know that?

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:44.550
Wuthering Heights... Heathcliff
is absolutely fantastic.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.650
You know of it, Mom?

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.550
I read it when I was a student.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:52.470
Wuthering Heights is a play based in England
around the turn of the 19th century, right?

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:56.810
Yep. They say the moors in Yorkshire, in northern
England, are known for the strong storms.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.700
Oh, a suspense story.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.430
What are you talking about?

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:03.940
It's a love tragedy between two childhood
friends named Heathcliff and Catherine.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:08.230
They love each other but they can't
get married in the end. Right?

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:09.770
Right?

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.500
Not sure I'm gonna get the story.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.480
I have to go.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.580
Aren't the high schoolers going on last?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.910
There's prep work to do!

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:24.820
The curtains will be raising shortly.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.550
Please move to your seats.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.510
Where the heck did Manjome-san go?

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:39.520
Look at these magnificent thorns.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.720
Let them come, those
tigers with their claws.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.480
There are no tigers on my planet.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.800
And besides, tigers don't eat weeds.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.560
I am not a weed.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.550
Forgive me...

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.860
Don't you wish Achan could
have been in this one?

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.340
Shinobu!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:04.800
I loved her, I did. But I came to see
it'd be painful to be together.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.190
Farewell!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:08.760
Farewell.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.350
I'm leaving this planet.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.130
Oh. Farewell.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.840
Sugimoto-sempai

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.290
Which ribbon would you like on it?

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:27.130
Umm... OK, the light blue one, please.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.430
All right. Light blue it is.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.910
And yet what they're looking for

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:47.870
could be found in a single
rose, or a little water...

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:52.150
But eyes are blind. You have
to look with the heart.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:59.290
Little Women

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.720
Geez, where were you?

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:11.580
Okudaira-san.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.230
Oh, hi.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.710
Is Kyoko here?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.830
Oh, Ikumi-san is-

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:19.280
Ko-chan! You're here.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.100
I wouldn't miss it for the world.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.680
You <i>do</i> realize you're
my fiancee, yes?

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.900
You're like a good older brother.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.330
Little Women is starting!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.250
OK!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.400
Finally, huh?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:33.980
I'm so nervous!

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:37.600
I'll take you home after the
play, since I drove here.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.330
Sorry, there's a wrap meeting afterwards.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.850
You don't have to wait for me.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.420
Bye.

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.800
I'll wait!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.660
Beth, don't die!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:58.340
Oh, Lord, save Beth! I promise
I'll never complain again!

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.560
I'll serve you forever, God!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.580
Sorry, this is coming apart here.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.590
I'll fix it.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.500
Hmm...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.230
Can you make it a little more wild?

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.700
Trust me, it's already pretty wild.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:20.220
Help me, Achan. Use your
hands and mess it up.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.330
What?! Me?!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.600
And massage my scalp while you're at it.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.470
Ah, that feels great.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.560
This relaxes me all the way to my soul.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.560
Sempai?

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.040
I may hide it well, but I'm pretty nervous.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:49.710
Thank you.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.310
D-Don't mention it.

00:10:54.810 --> 00:11:02.230
She's a feisty one, even when
it doesn't involve Fumi.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.020
Are you guys ready to go?

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:25.860
The Secondary School Presents "Wuthering Heights"

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.830
The Secondary School Presents "Wuthering Heights"

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.760
Have I visited that manor?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.650
Indeed I have.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:52.510
'Tis a place that reeks so much of bloodshed
that you cannot even breathe.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:56.640
Any sanctity of family has
been lost for all eternity.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:59.930
What happened there, you ask?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.350
Oh, I know it all too well.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.060
All about that manor.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.080
All about Wuthering Heights!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.770
The manor is owned by
the Earnshaw family.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:13.650
As the mother had long passed away,

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:18.490
I cared for the two children
there, as their nanny.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.450
One day, the master of the house

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:26.540
brought back a young boy in rags
and of no blood relation.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.970
Did you hear them scream?

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.480
Yeah.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.220
This is amazing.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.500
It's like watching a Takarazuka production.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.140
Though the others in the manor were
at a loss at how to deal with him,

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:45.770
the young daughter, Catherine, was the one
person who opened her heart to him.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.390
Your name is Heathcliff?

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.720
Yes. The master gave me that name.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:55.830
Heathcliff... A cliff of heath.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:13:00.120
You can weather any storm that comes,
bravely standing in the frigid cold.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.880
As my magnificent name says!

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:09.850
Catherine loved Heathcliff.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:14.310
And Heathcliff, too, loved Catherine.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.900
Hindley!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.260
My home has been a mess ever since
you walked through the door!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.520
Why does Father treat
you with such favour?!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.600
I'll run you out of here!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:37.750
Hindley, the older brother, despised
Heathcliff with a passion.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.860
He believed Heathcliff to have stolen
his father's love and affection.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.750
Ow...

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.310
My hair is stuck!

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.360
I'll get it out for you.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.240
Achan.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.720
Yes, this is your next wardrobe.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.710
Didn't you forget something?

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:51.730
Huh?

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.020
Ah, the hatchet!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.600
I'll be right back!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.440
You don't have to rush.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:01.750
Catherine would have thoughts of trying to
feign friendliness when she got older,

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:07.080
but ultimately she became a capricious
daughter, plagued by fits of rage.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:18.500
Music from dinner parties at a neighbouring
manor often reached Wuthering Heights.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:26.590
The lone son of that home, Edgar Linton,
fell in love with Catherine.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.990
Nelly! What should I do?

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.110
What is it, Young Mistress?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.150
You can't tell anyone.

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:41.650
Edgar proposed to me...

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.980
And I accepted.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.820
You agreed to it?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.210
Yes.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.300
But was that the right thing to do?

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.950
You already gave him your
answer, did you not?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.480
It's too late to change your mind now.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.120
Answer my question, Nelly!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:11.060
Why are you even hesitating? You can leave this desolate
manor and join their splendid household.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.870
It's not too tight?

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.110
You're an admirable girl too, Kyoko.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.010
Where is the problem with that?{in bg}

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.020
Even though it never pays off, right?

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.980
I love Edgar.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:19.960
Ah... Have I made the wrong choice?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.890
Are you worried about Heathcliff?{in bg}

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.190
What do you think... about Catherine?

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:25.190
Heathcliff?{in bg}

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.280
Huh?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:32.800
Heathcliff will indeed be sad once
he gets word of your marriage.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:36.060
Why? We're going to be together forever!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:39.620
He'll lose his feelings of
love and friendship,{in bg}

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:39.550
Kawasaki-sempai is really
quite the thespian.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.300
I'm not asking about her.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:42.530
if you become a member of
the Linton household.{in bg}

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:42.550
Huh?

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:45.620
You're wrong, Nelly! Wrong!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:46.500
Catherine.

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:50.090
Oh, I think she's an imposition.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:50.180
The two of us will
never be apart!{in bg}

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:56.030
No matter what happens, nothing
will pull us apart.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.700
But, umm... I'm envious.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:58.950
She's selfish but uninhibited. And
people forgive her for it.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.950
We'll never be apart, even if
someone ordered us to!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:02.980
The one in my heart is Heathcliff!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.860
As long as I have him, I can go on living!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.550
Everyone's selfish.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:18.490
Heathcliff is me and I am Heathcliff!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:21.760
I don't like her.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.470
Catherine!

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.570
You're cruel and insincere!

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:33.400
How can you betray your own heart?

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:35.630
Why did you leave me?

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:39.750
You left me and went off someplace too.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.840
But, I will forgive you.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:46.520
So please, forgive me.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.670
What a selfish woman.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.610
Catherine! Live, damn it!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.760
Ah, a hill of heath... I can see it.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.580
Wait for me, Heathcliff!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.290
Catherine...

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.120
Catherine!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.320
I killed you.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.500
So please, haunt me!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.510
I don't care what form you take!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:19.550
Don't... Don't leave me alone!

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:56.250
Give another large round of applause for
the members of the secondary school.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.890
That was great.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.140
It really was!

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.400
Great work out there, gals.

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.550
Kagami-sensei!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.860
Sensei!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.090
You can't just show up out of nowhere
with a bouquet of flowers.

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:28.130
Did you even watch the play?

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.340
Of course I did. You all looked incredible.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.270
You did great. Good job, good job.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.220
Geez, like I'm a little girl.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.710
Oh, Sensei...

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.380
Sugimoto, you too.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.250
You were great out there.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.990
Damn right, she was.
She deserves a reward.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.260
Thank you.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:00.830
Yes.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.000
Well done.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:09.680
Holy crap! Sugimoto's crying!

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:11.800
Sugimoto-sempai...

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.510
You saw something weird about me.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.980
It's not weird at all.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.500
It is.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.520
I hate it.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:49.570
Sempai...

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:54.530
I was thinking about this earlier.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:58.850
You've got someone else... Besides me...

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.810
Someone that you like, and...

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:07.690
Do you wanna know?

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.680
I don't wanna know. But
it's eating me up inside.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.920
It's in the past now.

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:21.630
OK.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:28.000
I was in love, me alone,

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.600
and that's all there was to it.

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.810
I wonder if I'm betraying you somehow.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.800
Of course not!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.740
Don't say that.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.720
I'm gonna be running the basketball team
for the first time in a while tomorrow.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.080
Wanna come and watch?

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.030
Sure.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.000
Let's go home, Fumi.

00:20:58.930 --> 00:20:59.960
Sure.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.700
Wuthering Heights (Part Two)

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.860
See you next time.
